{"card":{"card_id":"ma-c-c938e57017e68335bd6b","statement":"On $V_{l}\\ot V_{m}$, we have\n\n\\begin{align*}\nb_if_{i-1}\\wb^{(\\lb,\\mb)}_{\\jb}=\\quad&\\frac{[l_s+m_s-j_s+1]}{[l_s+m_s-2j_s+1]}(B'_1\\wb^{(\\lb-\\eb_s+\\eb_{s+1},\\mb)}_{\\jb}+B'_2\\wb^{(\\lb,\\mb-\\eb_s+\\eb_{s+1})}_{\\jb})\\\\\n+&\\frac{[j_{s+1}]}{[l_s+m_s-2j_s+1]}(B'_3\\wb^{(\\lb+\\eb_s-\\eb_{s+1},\\mb)}_{\\jb+\\eb_s-\\eb_{s+1}}+B'_4\\wb^{(\\lb,\\mb+\\eb_s-\\eb_{s+1})}_{\\jb+\\eb_s-\\eb_{s+1}})\\\\\n+&\\frac{[l_s+m_s-2j_s]}{[l_s+m_s-2j_s+1]}(D'_1f_{i-1}\\wb^{(\\lb-\\eb_s+\\eb_{s+1},\\mb)}_{\\jb-\\eb_s}+D'_2f_{i-1}\\wb^{(\\lb,\\mb-\\eb_s+\\eb_{s+1})}_{\\jb-\\eb_s}\\\\\n+&D'_3f_{i-1}\\wb^{(\\lb+\\eb_s-\\eb_{s+1},\\mb)}_{\\jb-\\eb_{s+1}}+D'_4f_{i-1}\\wb^{(\\lb,\\mb+\\eb_s-\\eb_{s+1})}_{\\jb-\\eb_{s+1}}),\\\\\n\\end{align*}\n\n\\begin{align*}\nb_if_{i+1}\\wb^{(\\lb,\\mb)}_{\\jb}=\\quad&\\frac{[j_s]}{[l_{s+1}+m_{s+1}-2j_{s+1}+1]}(C'_1\\wb^{(\\lb-\\eb_s+\\eb_{s+1},\\mb)}_{\\jb-\\eb_s+\\eb_{s+1}}+C'_2\\wb^{(\\lb,\\mb-\\eb_s+\\eb_{s+1})}_{\\jb-\\eb_s+\\eb_{s+1}})\\\\\n+&\\frac{[l_{s+1}+m_{s+1}-j_{s+1}+1]}{[l_{s+1}+m_{s+1}-2j_{s+1}+1]}(C'_3\\wb^{(\\lb+\\eb_s-\\eb_{s+1},\\mb)}_{\\jb}+C'_4\\wb^{(\\lb,\\mb+\\eb_s-\\eb_{s+1})}_{\\jb})\\\\\n+&\\frac{[l_{s+1}+m_{s+1}-2j_{s+1}]}{[l_{s+1}+m_{s+1}-2j_{s+1}+1]}(D'_1f_{i+1}\\wb^{(\\lb-\\eb_s+\\eb_{s+1},\\mb)}_{\\jb-\\eb_s}+D'_2f_{i+1}\\wb^{(\\lb,\\mb-\\eb_s+\\eb_{s+1})}_{\\jb-\\eb_s}\\\\\n+&D'_3f_{i+1}\\wb^{(\\lb+\\eb_s-\\eb_{s+1},\\mb)}_{\\jb-\\eb_{s+1}}+D'_4f_{i+1}\\wb^{(\\lb,\\mb+\\eb_s-\\eb_{s+1})}_{\\jb-\\eb_{s+1}}),\n\\end{align*}\n\nwhere\n\n\\begin{align*}\nB'_1&=q^{j_s-j_{s+1}-m_s+m_{s+1}}[l_s-j_s],\\quad\nB'_2=[m_s-j_s],\\\\\nB'_3&=-q^{j_s-j_{s+1}-l_s-m_s+l_{s+1}+m_{s+1}}[m_s-j_s],\\quad\nB'_4=-q^{2j_s-2j_{s+1}-l_s-2m_s+l_{s+1}+2m_{s+1}}[l_s-j_s],\\\\\nC'_1&=-q^{-j_s+j_{s+1}+l_s-l_{s+1}}[m_{s+1}-j_{s+1}],\\quad\nC'_2=-[l_{s+1}-j_{s+1}],\\\\\nC'_3&=q^{-j_s+j_{s+1}}[l_{s+1}-j_{s+1}],\\quad\nC'_4=q^{-2j_s+2j_{s+1}+l_s-l_{s+1}}[m_{s+1}-j_{s+1}],\\\\\n\\end{align*}","source_id":"arXiv:2012.00967","cluster":"mathematics","statement_sha256":"dc2a7c2de65c97079221b3a0b75aa7c4159422cd265302f97087025b4938ff2f","kind":"proposition","label":"Proposition 9","ref_key":"prop:bfw","name":"","order":14,"deps":[],"cite_keys":[],"provenance":{"source_url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2012.00967","harvest_mode":"arxiv_eprint","payload_sha256":"d1adc339d796c1ac2f8b9eb47b789e0355426463b407ef73101192b096da360b","line":555,"origin":"latex_env","retrieved_at":"2026-09-26T14:00:38+08:00"},"wash":{"version":"cardwash.v3","stages":["segment","purify","classify","dedupe","emit"],"numbering":"document_order_with_label_heuristic","detail":{"stripped_proof":false,"chars":1755,"math_hints":266}}},"paper":{"source_id":"arXiv:2012.00967","title":"Solution to the reflection equation related to the $\\iota$quantum group of type AII","abstract":"A solution to the reflection equation associated to a coideal subalgebra of $U_q(A_{2n-1}^{(1)})$ of type AII in the symmetric tensor representations is presented. If parameters of the coideal subalgebra are suitably chosen, the $K$ matrix does not depend on the quantum parameter $q$ and still agrees with a solution in arXiv:nlin/0411044 at $q=0$.","authors":["Hiroto Kusano","Masato Okado"],"year":"2020","url":"https://arxiv.org/abs/2012.00967","cluster":"mathematics","macros":{"Q":"{\\mathbb Q}","Z":"{\\mathbb Z}","eb":"\\boldsymbol{e}","jb":"\\boldsymbol{j}","lb":"\\boldsymbol{l}","mb":"\\boldsymbol{m}","ob":"\\boldsymbol{o}","ot":"\\otimes","pair":"\\langle{#1}\\rangle","U":"\\mathbf{U}","vep":"\\varepsilon","wb":"\\boldsymbol{w}"},"macros_override":[]},"deps":[],"dependents":[]}